        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    units_sold = 50000\n    purchase_costs = [\n        (40000, 17),  # Most recent purchase\n        (30000, 15),\n        (20000, 13)   # Beginning inventory\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    units_remaining = units_sold\n    cogs = 0\n\n    for units, cost_per_unit in purchase_costs:\n        units_used = min(units_remaining, units)\n        cogs += units_used * cost_per_unit\n        units_remaining -= units_used\n\n        if units_remaining == 0:\n            break\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(cogs)\n```",
